### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/forms/health

###

### Get Form Configuration
GET http://localhost:8080/api/forms/config

###

### Submit Valid Form - Basic
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "country": "ca"
}

###

### Submit Valid Form - US Resident with Age
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "jane.smith@example.com",
  "country": "us",
  "state": "ca",
  "age": 25
}

###

### Submit Valid Form - Complete with License
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Robert",
  "lastName": "Johnson",
  "email": "robert.johnson@example.com",
  "country": "us",
  "state": "ny",
  "age": 30,
  "hasLicense": true,
  "licenseNumber": "ABC123456",
  "employmentStatus": "employed",
  "companyName": "Tech Corp",
  "annualIncome": 75000,
  "comments": "This is a test submission"
}

###

### Submit Invalid Form - Missing Required Fields
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "J",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}

###

### Submit Invalid Form - US Resident without Age
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "country": "us"
}

###

### Submit Invalid Form - Has License but No License Number
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "country": "ca",
  "age": 25,
  "hasLicense": true
}

###

### Submit Invalid Form - Invalid Name Pattern
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John123",
  "lastName": "Doe@#$",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "country": "ca"
}

###

### Submit Invalid Form - Invalid License Number Format
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "country": "ca",
  "age": 25,
  "hasLicense": true,
  "licenseNumber": "abc123"
}

###

### Submit Valid Form - Employed with Company
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Williams",
  "email": "alice.williams@example.com",
  "country": "uk",
  "age": 28,
  "employmentStatus": "employed",
  "companyName": "Software Inc",
  "annualIncome": 65000
}

###

### Submit Invalid Form - Employed without Company Name
POST http://localhost:8080/api/forms/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Bob",
  "lastName": "Brown",
  "email": "bob.brown@example.com",
  "country": "de",
  "age": 35,
  "employmentStatus": "employed"
}

